{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of Scintilla</strong> is a first person hack and slash action rogue-like set in a dark fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Travel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/dbe74f0fd9eddd9be0fcdb1bd27a6c07.poster.avif?t=1760098852\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/dbe74f0fd9eddd9be0fcdb1bd27a6c07.webm?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/dbe74f0fd9eddd9be0fcdb1bd27a6c07.mp4?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time travel between the past and present, cutting down everything in your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Hack-and-Slash Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/47e28f2fa48cd95f589ff3adc6dda091.poster.avif?t=1760098852\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/47e28f2fa48cd95f589ff3adc6dda091.webm?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/47e28f2fa48cd95f589ff3adc6dda091.mp4?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of melee and ranged weapons to carve a bloody path through waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Upgrades and Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/d6120f42f74359a53dd62e41c55a5add.poster.avif?t=1760098852\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/d6120f42f74359a53dd62e41c55a5add.webm?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/d6120f42f74359a53dd62e41c55a5add.mp4?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of upgrades to create the perfect build\u2014or the strangest one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/9ab5cdfe7d126c87fbdccad50d9d80f2.poster.avif?t=1760098852\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/9ab5cdfe7d126c87fbdccad50d9d80f2.webm?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/extras/9ab5cdfe7d126c87fbdccad50d9d80f2.mp4?t=1760098852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses and uncover the secrets of mastering combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2287090?t=1760098852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2287090?t=1760098852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2287090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760098852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse